  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The ethyl bromide undergo elimination reaction with alc.KOH gives ethene.</p><p>Ethene gives dibromoethane with bromine in carbon tetra chloride. The dibromoethane converts to dicyanoethane with excess KCN. The dicyanoethane on hydrolysis gives Succinic Acid.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/48837356-4a3a-47bb-a9df-b0756ca8203d.png\" style=\"width: 755px; height: 394px;\"/></p>",
